# Read by Vite and exposed to the browser, so only public values go here.

# reCAPTCHA site keys, for localhost and the production domain. The v3 key
# scores every protected form invisibly; the v2 key renders the "I'm not a
# robot" checkbox when the API answers CAPTCHA_CHALLENGE_REQUIRED because a
# score was too low. Leave both unset in development and the API, which has
# no secrets either, accepts a placeholder token.
# VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
# VITE_RECAPTCHA_V2_SITE_KEY=
